          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwanakazi oyo wakalisamide zyakusama zyadowalowa azisalala tyu, alimwi walalisakatide ingolida amabwe mayandisi angale, nkabela mujanza lyakwe wakalijisi cinywido cangolida cizwide zisesemyo amatombe aabwaamu bwakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
