        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo Leza wakabika mumyoyo yabo oyu muyeeyo wakulomya bukanze bwakwe. Boonse balazumina camoyo omwe kupa cinyama bwami bwabo, mane majwi aa-Leza akalondolwe. ",
